"onboard_title_ios_data" = "What Portway sends, and to whom.";
"onboard_body_ios_data" = "Only to the panel of the provider who gave you the config — never to Portway's developer, never to advertisers, never sold:\n\n• the config's public key and address, to look up your plan and days left\n• a random ID for this install, the device model and the iOS and app versions, so a config is used on one device at a time\n• while connected, once a minute: whether the server is answering, how long since the last handshake, bytes moved this session, restarts and Wi-Fi or mobile\n\nYour private key, the sites you visit and your traffic never leave the tunnel. To show the city a server is in, Portway may ask a public location service — only through the tunnel, so it sees the server, not you.";
